# Frankie's Dot (UNO Q). Copy to /home/arduino/ketchup-dot.env, fill in, then: chmod 600 ~/ketchup-dot.env
# One KEY=value per line, no quotes, no spaces around "=".
# Your Mac's name from: scutil --get LocalHostName   (add .local)
KETCHUP_SERVER=http://YOUR-MAC-NAME.local:8787
PEBBLE_ID=frankie
PEBBLE_AUDIO=plughw:CARD=Device,DEV=0
PEBBLE_TTS=espeak
META_API_KEY=PASTE_YOUR_META_API_KEY_HERE
# Pad (no mic on the UNO Q): short press = keep the time; hold this long = find another time
# PEBBLE_LONG_PRESS_S=1.0
# Orange of the "a time is waiting" breathing, r,g,b 0..255 (tune to your LED)
# PEBBLE_ORANGE=255,90,0
# Which colour each sketch pin lights, D3 D5 D6. grb (default): this LED has red and green swapped
# (green showed red, orange showed green). Use rgb if the LED is rewired R=D3, G=D5, B=D6.
# PEBBLE_LED_ORDER=grb
# 1 (default): Frankie answers after Mayo; yellow breathing until Mayo has answered, then orange.
# 0: orange as soon as a time is ready, like the Pi.
# PEBBLE_ANSWER_SECOND=1
# Seconds the LED stays green once booked, then dim white
# PEBBLE_GREEN_S=10
